                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Hoo-Boy is a platformer game.\n\nYou are welcomed to the game by starting on the very last level after pressing the play button, which without any practice beforehand, which feels like you're playing a Super Meat Boy level, minus the smooth controls. The camera is so zoomed in that all your jumps are practically leaps of fate into spikes... both of those things happening in the first minute of your game is a good incentive enough to avoid it.\n\nOverall, difficult precision platformer with an uncomfortably zoomed in camera that ends up killing you, unfun.",
